  "properties": {
    "title": "EOPF Zarr Access",
    "description": "EOPF Toolkit - Python and R Zarr access\n\nThis talk will describe the EOPF Zarr format and present practical notebooks in Python and R for accessing ESA Sentinel data. It will touch on practical use cases for Sentinel 1, 2, and 3 Zarr data access and help users understand the EOPF ecosystem and the tooling best suited to access and exploit EOPF data.",
